WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:01.500
Here's how Flint works.

2
00:00:01.967 --> 00:00:07.233
First, tell Flint the job you want, where you're starting from, and how many hours you have each week.

3
00:00:07.900 --> 00:00:11.600
Flint builds your plan: a path of projects, sized to your pace.

4
00:00:12.467 --> 00:00:17.433
Open a project. The brief lists exactly what to deliver, and the data you'll need.

5
00:00:18.167 --> 00:00:22.667
Then talk it through. Your manager wants numbers. Your coach helps you find them.

6
00:00:23.533 --> 00:00:29.567
When it's ready, submit for review. You're scored on insight, quality, communication and reliability.

7
00:00:30.767 --> 00:00:34.433
The project lands in your portfolio, as proof of what you can do.

8
00:00:35.167 --> 00:00:36.400
Then pick the next one.
